// Granted by Heroes/Brute's JuggernautChargedSpeedSkillAction - while present, JuggernautSkillData's
// own ResolveChargedMoveSpeedBonus adds SpeedBonusIncrease to the Charged speed tier only, not the
// baseline Active tier (see JuggernautActiveSpeedUpgrade for that one, a separate, independently
// pickable upgrade rather than one combined "increase both" card). Read live each time the resolver
// runs rather than baked in once at Begin - safe since this is Begin-only, never revoked, so it can't
// change mid-activation.
//
// Begin-only, deliberately not paired with End - same reasoning as every other "configures what the
// skill does" upgrade this session: re-granting fresh (idempotent) every activation and never
// removing it means it's simply always there once picked, with nothing to race against.
component JuggernautChargedSpeedUpgrade
{
    FP SpeedBonusIncrease;
}
